## 🏗️ System Architecture

Continuity follows a modular architecture that separates the user interface,
application services, persistent health data, and semantic memory.

```text
User
  │
  ▼
Streamlit Interface
  │
  ▼
Application Services
  ├── Check-in Service
  ├── Memory Service
  └── Health/Report Processing
  │
  ├───────────────┐
  ▼               ▼
SQLite        Semantic Memory
  │               │
  │        Sentence Transformers
  │               │
  │          SQLite / Qdrant
  │               │
  └───────┬───────┘
          ▼
Health Timeline & Reports
